{"id": 4296, "title": "Philosophy of Life in Porcelain", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "philosophy-of-life-in-porcelain", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4296_philosophy-of-life-in-porcelain.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["去旅游时,我买了一件珍贵的瓷器。瓷器用大箱子装着，大箱子里的间隙塞满了废纸，我考虑到大箱子携带不方便，就扔掉了大箱子和里面的废纸，直接把瓷器放进了我的行李箱中。", "上车时，由于不小心，我的行李箱重重地摔到了地上。打开行李箱一看，那件珍贵的瓷器已经碎了。这时我才后悔扔掉了那些看起来好像没用的废纸。", "其实没有什么东西是完全没用的，哪怕是那些废纸，在某些方面，它们也有着自己独特的功能。只要用到合适的地方，废纸也能发挥重要的作用。所以，不要看轻别人，看轻那些\"废纸”，因为任何事物都有自己的价值。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["去旅遊時,我買了一件珍貴的瓷器。瓷器用大箱子裝著，大箱子裡的間隙塞滿了廢紙，我考慮到大箱子攜帶不方便，就扔掉了大箱子和裡面的廢紙，直接把瓷器放進了我的行李箱中。", "上車時，由於不小心，我的行李箱重重地摔到了地上。打開行李箱一看，那件珍貴的瓷器已經碎了。這時我才後悔扔掉了那些看起來好像沒用的廢紙。", "其實沒有什麼東西是完全沒用的，哪怕是那些廢紙，在某些方面，它們也有著自己獨特的功能。只要用到合適的地方，廢紙也能發揮重要的作用。所以，不要看輕別人，看輕那些\"廢紙”，因為任何事物都有自己的價值。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["qù lǚ yóu shí , wǒ mǎi le yī jiàn zhēn guì de cí qì。 cí qì yòng dà xiāng zi zhuāng zhe， dà xiāng zi lǐ de jiàn xì sāi mǎn le fèi zhǐ， wǒ kǎo lǜ dào dà xiāng zi xié dài bù fāng biàn， jiù rēng diào le dà xiāng zi hé lǐ miàn de fèi zhǐ， zhí jiē bǎ cí qì fàng jìn le wǒ de xíng li xiāng zhōng。", "shàng chē shí， yóu yú bù xiǎo xīn， wǒ de xíng li xiāng zhòng zhòng de shuāi dào le dì shàng。 dǎ kāi xíng li xiāng yī kàn， nà jiàn zhēn guì de cí qì yǐ jīng suì le。 zhè shí wǒ cái hòu huǐ rēng diào le nà xiē kàn qǐ lái hǎo xiàng méi yòng de fèi zhǐ。", "qí shí méi yǒu shén me dōng xi shì wán quán méi yòng de， nǎ pà shì nà xiē fèi zhǐ， zài mǒu xiē fāng miàn， tā men yě yǒu zhe zì jǐ dú tè de gōng néng。 zhǐ yào yòng dào hé shì de dì fang， fèi zhǐ yě néng fā huī zhòng yào de zuò yòng。 suǒ yǐ， bù yào kàn qīng bié rén， kàn qīng nà xiē \" fèi zhǐ”， yīn wèi rèn hé shì wù dōu yǒu zì jǐ de jià zhí。"], "english_paragraphs": ["When I was traveling, I bought a precious piece of porcelain. The porcelain was packed in a big box, and the gaps in the big box were filled with waste paper. Considering that the big box was inconvenient to carry, I threw away the big box and the waste paper inside, and put the porcelain directly into my suitcase.", "When I got in the car, my suitcase fell heavily to the ground due to accident. When I opened the suitcase, I saw that the precious porcelain was broken. Only then did I regret throwing away those seemingly useless pieces of paper.", "In fact, nothing is completely useless. Even those waste papers have their own unique functions in some aspects. As long as it is used in the right place, waste paper can also play an important role. So, don't look down on others or those \"waste papers\", because everything has its own value."], "english_full": "When I was traveling, I bought a precious piece of porcelain. The porcelain was packed in a big box, and the gaps in the big box were filled with waste paper. Considering that the big box was inconvenient to carry, I threw away the big box and the waste paper inside, and put the porcelain directly into my suitcase.\n\nWhen I got in the car, my suitcase fell heavily to the ground due to accident. When I opened the suitcase, I saw that the precious porcelain was broken. Only then did I regret throwing away those seemingly useless pieces of paper.\n\nIn fact, nothing is completely useless. Even those waste papers have their own unique functions in some aspects. As long as it is used in the right place, waste paper can also play an important role. So, don't look down on others or those \"waste papers\", because everything has its own value.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù\" data-defn=\"to go, to go to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǚ yóu\" data-defn=\"to travel\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">旅游</span><span class=\"tr\">旅遊</span><rt>lǚ yóu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shí\" data-defn=\"when\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2(6)\"><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-def