ent; suitable\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">方便</span><span class=\"tr\">方便</span><rt>fāng biàn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiù\" data-defn=\"in that case; then\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rēng diào\" data-defn=\"to throw away / to throw out\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">扔掉</span><span class=\"tr\">扔掉</span><rt>rēng diào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà\" data-defn=\"big; large; great / older (than another person) / eldest\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiāng zi\" data-defn=\"suitcase / chest / box / case / trunk\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">箱子</span><span class=\"tr\">箱子</span><rt>xiāng zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǐ miàn\" data-defn=\"inside / interior\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">里面</span><span class=\"tr\">裡面</span><rt>lǐ miàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fèi zhǐ\" data-defn=\"waste paper\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">废纸</span><span class=\"tr\">廢紙</span><rt>fèi zhǐ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhí jiē\" data-defn=\"direct / immediate / straightforward\" data-h