 data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">车</span><span class=\"tr\">車</span><rt>chē</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shí\" data-defn=\"when\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2(6)\"><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yóu yú\" data-defn=\"due to / as a result of / thanks to / owing to / since / because\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">由于</span><span class=\"tr\">由於</span><rt>yóu yú</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo xīn\" data-defn=\"to be careful / to take care\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">小心</span><span class=\"tr\">小心</span><rt>xiǎo xīn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xíng li xiāng\" data-defn=\"suitcase / baggage compartment / overhead bin / (car) trunk / boot\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">行李箱</span><span class=\"tr\">行李箱</span><rt>xíng li xiāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhòng zhòng\" data-defn=\"heavily / severely\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">重重</span><span class=\"tr\">重重</span><rt>zhòng zhòng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"-ly / structural particle: used before a verb or adjective, linking it to preceding modifying adverbial adjunct\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuāi\" data-defn=\"to thro